# Prettier lays out the TypeScript and Astro under packages/ and nothing else.
# This file is that scope: `pnpm format` and `format:check` run Prettier on the
# whole repo, and so does a stray `prettier --write <file>`, so Markdown keeps
# its tables as written (#383).
*
!*/
!/packages/**/*.ts
!/packages/**/*.tsx
!/packages/**/*.astro
